      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before settlers, the Sokokis tribe of the Abenaki hunted the area Standish, with trails like the Ossipee Trail (now Route 25) and the Pequawket Trail (now Route 113) crossing it.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
